      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to <b>Code Fries</b>!\nA 2-player co-op command puzzle game.\n\n<b>How
    to play:</b>\n\u2022  Drag command blocks into each player's sequence.\n\u2022 
    Commands: Walk, Run, Walk Back, Turn Left, Turn Right, Wait, Press Button.\n\u2022 
    Use the <b>Repeat / Loop</b> toggle on a block to run it multiple times.\n\u2022 
    Both players must press <b>READY</b> before the run starts.\n\u2022  Press <b>RUN</b>
    to execute both sequences at the same time.\n\u2022  If the plan fails, fix your
    commands and try again.\n\u2022  Reach the <b>End Tiles</b> together to win.\n\u2022 
    <b>Enemy Tiles</b> trigger coding questions \u2014 answer correctly to pass."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
